                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "\"I came in not knowing what to expect. I left with three contacts, a clearer sense of direction, and a full-time offer six months later. Tech Treks is the highest-leverage thing I did at NYU.\"",
